# Conditional mappings, 23 digits each: the code point (6), language (1: none, lt, tr,
# az), condition (1: none, Final_Sigma, After_Soft_Dotted, More_Above, Before_Dot,
# After_I; +8 for Not_), then lowercase, titlecase and uppercase (offset 4, length 1,
# length 0xf for the code point itself).
